1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，语言分量及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_L\">\\(\\Sigma_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}\">\\(\\operatorname{lit}\\)</span> 与带括号的符号应用字符串构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in T^n\">\\(\\bar t\\in T^n\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的函数，分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t(i)\">\\(\\bar t(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是下式量化的候选闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_L:=\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{T\\subseteq\\Sigma_L^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\{\\operatorname{lit}(s):s\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\cup\\mathrm{Const}_L\\}\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\\forall\\bar t\\in T^n\\;\n\\bigl(f(\\bar t(0),\\ldots,\\bar t(n-1))\\in T\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\